with damaged or flooded road access.</li>\n<li>Coalition integration: shared assets, joint procurement, and pooled transport.</li>\n<li>Resource gap analysis and logistics prioritization briefs for field commanders.</li>\n<li>To prevent the “Second Disaster” we conduct post-deployment inventory reconciliation and lessons learned documentation.</li>\n</ul>","donationFundsHtml","<p>Donations fund fuel and transportation to move supplies, emergency stockpiles (water, food, shelter materials), personnel safety gear, and the tracking tools that provide real-time supply visibility. Logistical unity extends IRG&#39;s reach through a broader network of shared assets.</p>",{"_57":329,"_324":330,"_326":315},{"_57":327,"_324":328,"_326":317},{"_57":323,"_324":325,"_326":319},"what-your-donation-funds","heading","What your donation funds","html","how-we-do-it","How we do it","what-we-do","What we do"]
